# RedOS CI/CD Integration

## Overview

CI/CD pipeline integrations for RedOS Security Platform. Gates and security scanning triggered
on pull requests, commits, and deployment pipelines. All results flow into the RedOS finding
and attack campaign system.

## GitHub Integration

### Workflow: `.github/workflows/redos-security-scan.yml`

```yaml
name: RedOS Security Scan

on:
  pull_request:
    types: [opened, synchronize, reopened, edited]
  push:
    branches: [main, develop, release/*]
  workflow_dispatch:

jobs:
  security-scan:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    permissions:
      contents: read
      security-events: write
      actions: read

    steps:
      - name: Checkout repository
        uses: actions/checkout@v4

      - name: Set up Node.js
        uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: '20'

      - name: Install dependencies
        run: |
          npm ci

      - name: Run RedOS Security Scan
        env:
          REDOS_API_URL: ${{ secrets.REDOS_API_URL }}
          REDOS_API_KEY: ${{ secrets.REDOS_API_KEY }}
          REDOS_ORG_ID: ${{ secrets.REDOS_ORG_ID }}
        run: |
          # Run the security scan
          npm run scan -- --api-url $REDOS_API_URL --api-key $REDOS_API_KEY --org-id $REDOS_ORG_ID

      - name: Upload findings to RedOS
        env:
          REDOS_API_URL: ${{ secrets.REDOS_API_URL }}
          REDOS_API_KEY: ${{ secrets.REDOS_API_KEY }}
        run: |
          # POST findings to RedOS API
          curl -X POST "$REDOS_API_URL/api/v1/findings/batch" \
            -H "Authorization: Bearer $REDOS_API_KEY" \
            -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
            -d @findings.json

      - name: Gate Evaluation
        env:
          REDOS_API_URL: ${{ secrets.REDOS_API_URL }}
          REDOS_API_KEY: ${{ secrets.REDOS_API_KEY }}
        run: |
          # Evaluate security gates
          curl -X POST "$REDOS_API_URL/api/v1/gates/evaluate" \
            -H "Authorization: Bearer $REDOS_API_KEY" \
            -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
            -d {
              "campaign_id": "${{ github.event.pull_request.head.sha }}",
              "organization_id": "${{ secrets.REDOS_ORG_ID }}"
            }

      - name: Comment PR with Results
        uses: actions/github-script@v7
        env:
          REDOS_API_URL: ${{ secrets.REDOS_API_URL }}
          REDOS_API_KEY: ${{ secrets.REDOS_API_KEY }}
        with:
          github-token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}
          script: |
            const results = await fetch("$REDOS_API_URL/api/v1/gates/config", {
              headers: { Authorization: `Bearer $REDOS_API_KEY` }
            }).then(r => r.json())

            let comment = `## RedOS Security Scan Results\n\n`
            
            if (results.BLOCK_CRITICAL?.result === 'block') {
              comment += `❌ **BLOCK**: Critical finding detected - campaign launch prevented\n`
            } else {
              comment += `✅ **PASS**: No critical findings\n`
            }
            
            if (results.WARN_MEDIUM_INCREASE?.result === 'warn') {
              comment += `⚠️ **WARN**: Medium risk threshold exceeded: ${results.WARN_MEDIUM_INCREASE.medium_count}/${results.WARN_MEDIUM_INCREASE.threshold}\n`
            }
            
            comment += `\n_PGate evaluation completed_`

            await github.rest.issues.createComment({
              owner: context.repo.owner,
              repo: context.repo.repo,
              issue_number: context.issue.number,
              body: comment
            })
```

### GitHub Marketplace App

RedOS GitHub App provides:

- **Repository permissions**: Read contents, pull requests, discussions
- **Webhook events**: `pull_request`, `push`, `workflow_run`
- **Installation scope**: Organization-wide or repository-specific
- **Setup flow**: OAuth app installation with redirect URI

### Secrets Management

| Secret | Source | Rotation |
|--------|--------|----------|
| `REDOS_API_KEY` | Organization vault | 90 days |
| `REDOS_API_URL` | Deployment config | Never rotates |
| `GITHUB_APP_TOKEN` | GitHub API | Session-based |
| `SSL_CERTIFICATE` | Kubernetes secret | 365 days |

## GitLab Integration

### Pipeline Job: `.gitlab-ci.yml`

```yaml
redos_security_scan:
  stage: security
  image: node:20
  services:
    - name: redis:7
      alias: redis
  variables:
    REDOS_API_URL: https://api.redos.io
    REDOS_API_KEY: $REDOS_API_KEY
  script:
    - npm ci
    - npm run scan -- --api-url $REDOS_API_URL --api-key $REDOS_API_KEY
    - curl -X POST "$REDOS_API_URL/api/v1/findings/batch" -H "Authorization: Bearer $REDOS_API_KEY" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d @findings.json
    - curl -X POST "$REDOS_API_URL/api/v1/gates/evaluate" -H "Authorization: Bearer $REDOS_API_KEY" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"campaign_id": "$CI_COMMIT_SHA", "organization_id": "$REDOS_ORG_ID"}'
  only:
    - merge_requests
    - main
  artifacts:
    paths:
      - findings.json
      - gate-decisions.json
    expire_in: 1 day
```

