## CI Pipeline Integrations

### Generic CI/CD Support

| CI System | Trigger | Artifact | Gate Evaluation |
|-----------|---------|----------|-----------------|
| **Jenkins** | `post-success` | `findings.json` | `curl` to `/api/v1/gates/evaluate` |
| **CircleCI** | `workflow_complete` | `gate-decisions.json` | Orb integration |
| **Travis CI** | `finish` | `report.json` | Environment variable gates |
| **Bamboo** | `Completed` | `security-report.xml` | Task result action |
| **Azure DevOps** | `PipelineCompletion` | `findings.json` | REST API integration |

