## Security Gate Policies as Code

Organizations can version-control gate configurations:

```bash
# Export gate config
redos-cli gates export --org org_oid --file gates.json

# Git commit
git add gates.json
git commit -m "Update critical finding threshold to 0"
git push

# Import to staging org
redos-cli gates import --org staging_oid --file gates.json

# Diff between versions
redos-cli gates diff --org prod_oid --version v1.2.1 --version v1.2.0
```

This enables:
- Gate configuration as code
- Review and approval workflows via Git
- Change tracking and full audit trail
- Multi-environment consistency (dev/staging/prod)
- Rollback to previous gate configurations